{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231200","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1423120001:0":{"text":"아이언비어드 형님, 여긴 무슨 일이셔?","source_cn":"铁须老大，您怎么来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA08B53703CC6F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423120002:1":{"text":"시킬 일이라도 있수? 말만 하셔! 금방 해치울 테니까!","source_cn":"有什么活要俺们干的吗？俺们手脚麻利得很！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282C5D6BC1B9E03B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423120003:1":{"text":"일할 때보다 훨씬 더 열심이네.","source_cn":"你现在干活倒是积极起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC63AEB9C39845FA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423120004:1":{"text":"아이언비어드 형님에게 붙기로 했으니까.","source_cn":"毕竟俺们正式加入铁须老大这边了嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0690A0E50E58C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423120005:1":{"text":"지금 너희가 할 일은 없고.","source_cn":"现在还用不着你们动手干活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EC44D77195FA44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423120006:1":{"text":"조금 있다가 볼 게 마음에 든다면 다들 얼마든지 일하고 싶어할 테니까.","source_cn":"要是等会看到的东西能让我满意，我相信大伙干多少活都愿意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x304F7833E6E232E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423120007:1":{"text":"뭐... 일할 사람도 없으니 천청광은 저희가 직접 캐와야겠네요.","source_cn":"行吧……既然没有人干活，我们就亲自去采些天青矿吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B008C128CB3496D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:怠惰的矮人":{"text":"게으른 드워프","source":"怠惰的矮人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:海拉":{"text":"헬라","source":"海拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:铁须":{"text":"아이언비어드","source":"铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}